   "id": "drive",
   "name": "Drive",
   "kind": "state",
   "tier": 1,
   "blurb": "Every beat hits: the two pairs call and respond, downbeats flash white, the head sweeps the room. The bed for a chorus or drop. stagger delays each lamp by a fraction of a beat across the rig, so the figure arrives left to right instead of all at once; 0 is together, 0.25 is a quarter beat apart. Hits and alternates its pairs once per beat unless `every_beats` says otherwise; on a slow or devotional song the bar is usually the right rate and the beat reads as frantic",
   "dimension": "amount",
   "returns": false,
   "dials": {
    "amount": {
     "default": 0.85,
     "min": 0.5,
     "max": 1.0
